%% CrestFlow - Sequence Diagram: Policy Evaluation (report level)
%% Type: UML sequence diagram
%% Rule: one policy gate, nine checks, fail closed.
sequenceDiagram
  participant ORC as Orchestrator
  participant PE as Policy Engine
  participant DATA as Policy data and audit
  participant CCE as CCE

  ORC->>PE: simulated package
  PE->>DATA: load policy input
  DATA-->>PE: user, KYC, risk, goals, spend
  PE->>PE: evaluate nine checks
  PE->>DATA: save decision and nine results

  alt APPROVED
    PE-->>ORC: APPROVED
    ORC->>CCE: authorize execution
  else BLOCKED
    PE-->>ORC: BLOCKED with all failures
  end

  note over PE: Checks are KYC, tier spend, authority,<br/>risk, chain, protocol, per-tx value,<br/>slippage, action type
  note over PE: No short-circuit, all nine results recorded
  note over ORC: No execution path bypasses policy
